### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-quicklook
### The terminal UI: Quick Look and the grid / gallery views (Phase T4).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-quicklook.ftl.

## T4.6: Quick Look (view/quicklook.rs)

# Position of the shown item in the list; $pos: 1-based, $count: visible items.
tui-quicklook-position = { $pos } / { $count }
tui-quicklook-hint-scroll = scroll
# An image the terminal cannot draw; $width, $height: its size in pixels.
tui-quicklook-image = Image, { $width } × { $height } px
